{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Molecular.h2_lp_dual_binding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Molecular.h2_lp_dual_binding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.h2_lp_dual_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.h2_lp_dual_binding","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L107-L122","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `H2GroundStateSelection`)** — the resolving\ndeclaration for `lean.ref` `qou:QOU.Molecular.h2_lp_dual_binding`.\n\nConjoins the two genuinely-derived facts: (1) the molecular-volume\ndecomposition `Φ₁^{H₂} = Σ ln|V̂ᵢ|` (sorry-free algebra) and (2) the\nnon-negative binding shadow price `0 ≤ Φ₁^sep − Φ₁^{H₂}` (derived by\n*using* the §3b-cond ground-state hypothesis at the separated\nordering).  Neither conjunct projects a conclusion field. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:h2-lp-dual-binding","label":"prop:h2-lp-dual-binding","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2-lp-dual-binding.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.h2_binding_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.h2_binding_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L89-L105","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `H2GroundStateSelection`)** — H₂ binding\nshadow price non-negative: `0 ≤ Φ₁^sep − Φ₁^{H₂}`.\n\nDerived (not projected): instantiate the ground-state-minimisation\n*hypothesis* at the separated ordering `π = separated`, giving\n`Φ₁(interleaved) ≤ Φ₁(separated)`; rewrite both sides through the\ndefinitional links `interleaved_is_H2` and `separated_is_sep`,\nyielding `Φ₁^{H₂} ≤ Φ₁^sep`.  A new numeric inequality obtained by\n*using* the hypothesis at one point, not restating it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.h2_molecular_volume_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.h2_molecular_volume_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L78-L87","doc":"**H₂ molecular-volume decomposition** — derived sorry-free.\n\nThe molecular volume equals the sum of the three log-magnitudes,\nfrom the defining equation `Phi1_H2_def` (genuine algebra, not a\nprojection). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2GroundStateSelection.ground_state_minimises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2GroundStateSelection.ground_state_minimises","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L74-L74","doc":"The interleaved ordering achieves the minimum `Φ₁` over all `S₄`\norderings (the ground-state selection hypothesis). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2GroundStateSelection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2GroundStateSelection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2GroundStateSelection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2GroundStateSelection","kind":"class","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L66-L76","doc":"§3b-cond conjecture class (non-degenerate per AGENTS.md §3b-cond\nitem 5): carries the conjectural LP-dual ground-state *hypothesis*\n— the interleaved ordering is the `Φ₁`-minimiser over `S₄` — as a\nfield, NOT the conclusion (the binding inequality is *derived* from\nit below). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.separated_is_sep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.separated_is_sep","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L64-L64","doc":"`Φ₁` of the separated ordering equals `Φ₁^sep` (definitional link). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_sep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_sep","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The separated-atom reference value `Φ₁^sep` (definitional link). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.separated","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.separated","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The separated (two-isolated-atoms) ordering. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.interleaved_is_H2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.interleaved_is_H2","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Its `Φ₁` is the molecular volume `Φ₁^{H₂}` (definitional link). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.interleaved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.interleaved","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The interleaved ground-state ordering `[𝔭₁, e₂, 𝔭₂, e₁]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_of_ordering","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_of_ordering","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L54-L54","doc":"`Φ₁` of every strand ordering `π ∈ S₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_H2_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_H2_def","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L50-L50","doc":"`Φ₁^{H₂}` is the sum of the three log-magnitudes (definitional\ninput — the molecular volume's defining formula). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_H2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.Phi1_H2","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The molecular `Φ₁` for H₂, *defined* as the sum of the\nlog-magnitudes of the traced volumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.V_hat_H2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.V_hat_H2","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Traced volume `V̂ᵢ^{H₂}` of the three crossings (indices `0..2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2LpDualBindingContext","kind":"class","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/h2_lp_dual_binding.lean#L40-L64","doc":"Data of the H₂ LP-dual-binding claim. All fields are *inputs*; none\nis the conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}